WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:03.576
OKAY, HERE'S THE THING.
ALL ACTORS KNOW THIS.

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:06.720
YOU CAN BE PRIMED TO GIVE THE
PERFORMANCE OF YOUR LIFE, BUT IF

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:09.520
YOU SHOW UP AND YOUR HAIR LOOKS
WRONG, ALL ANYBODY WILL BE

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:12.320
LOOKING AT IS YOUR HAIR.
AND IF YOU SHOW UP AND YOUR

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:16.000
COSTUME IS WRONG, ALL ANYBODY
WILL BE LOOKING AT IS YOUR COSTUME.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.585
BEFORE YOU'VE EVEN SPOKEN
A LINE, YOU'RE DONE.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:20.960
FOR BEST MAKEUP
AND HAIR STYLING,

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:23.440
FIVE DIFFERENT TEAMS
OF THREE ARE NOMINATED.

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.800
THESE ARTISTS SHARED THEIR
VARIOUS PATHS TO TONIGHT.

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:29.840
ONE BEGAN BY DOING
MAKEUP ON HIMSELF.

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:32.960
ANOTHER GOT STARTED BY
SHOWING UP ON A SET AT

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:34.720
3:00 A.M. TO HOLD HAIRPINS.

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:38.080
OTHERS BY WORKING FOR FREE ON
SMALL INDEPENDENT FILMS.

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:41.600
HERE ARE THE NOMINEES FOR MAKEUP
AND HAIRSTYLING.

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:47.840
"EMMA," MARESE LANGAN.
LAURA ALLEN, CLAUDIA STOLZE.

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:52.240
[ APPLAUSE ]

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:55.120
"HILLBILLY ELEGY,"
ERYN KRUEGER,

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:57.440
MATTHEW MUNGLE AND
PATRICIA DEHANEY.

00:00:57.440 --> 00:01:02.000
[ APPLAUSE ]

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.520
"MA RAINEY'S BLACK BOTTOM,"
SERGIO LOPEZ-RIVERA.

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:11.840
MIA NEAL, AND JAMIKA WILSON.

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:12.560
[ APPLAUSE ]

00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:15.040
"MANK," GIGI WILLIAMS,

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:17.440
KIMBERLEY SPITERI, AND
COLLEEN LABAFF.

00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:22.240
[ APPLAUSE ]

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:26.080
"PINOCCHIO," MARK COULIER,
DALIA COLLI, AND

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:28.400
FRANCESCO PEGORETTI.

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:34.960
AND THE OSCAR GOES TO --

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:37.840
"MA RAINEY'S BLACK BOTTOM,"

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:41.621
SERGIO LOPEZ-RIVERA,
MIA NEAL, AND JAMIKA WILSON.

00:01:41.621 --> 00:01:55.436
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:12.460
I WAS RAISED BY MY
GRANDFATHER, JAMES HOLLAND.

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:15.423
HE WAS AN ORIGINAL TUSKEGEE AIRMAN.

00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:19.040
HE REPRESENTED THE U.S.
IN THE FIRST PAN AM GAMES.

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:21.920
HE WENT TO ARGENTINA, HE MET EVITA.

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:25.360
HE GRADUATED FROM NORTHWESTERN
UNIVERSITY AT A TIME THAT

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:29.120
THEY DID NOT ALLOW BLACKS TO STAY ON
CAMPUS, SO HE STAYED AT THE Y.M.C.A.

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:33.680
AND AFTER ALL OF HIS ACCOMPLISHMENTS,
HE WENT BACK TO HIS HOMETOWN

00:02:33.680 --> 00:02:37.200
IN HOPES OF BECOMING
A TEACHER, BUT THEY DID NOT

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:39.120
HIRE BLACKS IN THE SCHOOL SYSTEM.

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:44.640
SO, I WANT TO SAY THANK YOU TO OUR
ANCESTORS WHO PUT THE WORK IN

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:46.640
WERE DENIED BUT NEVER GAVE UP

00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:51.440
AND I ALSO STAND HERE, AS JAMIKA
AND I BREAK THIS GLASS CEILING

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:53.760
WITH SO MUCH EXCITEMENT
FOR THE FUTURE.

00:02:53.760 --> 00:02:58.800
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:03.280
BECAUSE I CAN PICTURE BLACK
TRANS WOMEN STANDING UP HERE,

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:07.600
AND ASIAN SISTERS AND
OUR LATINA SISTERS, AND

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:11.280
INDIGENOUS WOMEN.
AND I KNOW THAT ONE DAY

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:14.160
IT WON'T BE UNUSUAL OR
GROUNDBREAKING,

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:15.840
IT WILL JUST BE NORMAL.

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:22.160
THANK YOU TO THE ACADEMY,
TO NETFLIX, TO DENZEL WASHINGTON,

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:28.219
TO GEORGE C. WOLFE, TO ANN ROTH
TO MISS VIOLA DAVIS

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:34.720
TO MATIKI ANOFF,
TO ANDREA RESNICK,

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:36.902
TO THE SPIRIT OF MA RAINEY.

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:39.398
THANK YOU.

